01:23:15.380 --> 01:23:16.810
Okay.


01:23:16.820 --> 01:23:18.310
All right.


01:23:21.790 --> 01:23:23.620
Whoa, whoa.


01:23:25.330 --> 01:23:26.820
Come on.


01:23:27.490 --> 01:23:29.990
