Get him!


01:23:30.000 --> 01:23:31.490
Oh, man!


01:23:32.170 --> 01:23:34.930
Guys, good effort.


01:23:34.940 --> 01:23:37.060
Uh, Swackhamer, you got this.


01:23:37.070 --> 01:23:39.030
- Come on, Swackhamer.
- Whoo! Okay.


01:23:39.040 --> 01:23:41.630
