01:24:35.900 --> 01:24:37.050
Amateurs!


01:24:38.870 --> 01:24:42.030
Wow! I did not
need to see that!


01:25:07.190 --> 01:25:10.390
What's good for the Graboid
is good for the Gummer.


01:25:10.560 --> 01:25:12.050
All right.


01:25:19.140 --> 01:25:21.000
