good pets, Mr. Cutts.


01:30:20.140 --> 01:30:21.400
Preach on it, Burt!


01:30:21.410 --> 01:30:24.240
Yeah!


01:30:24.750 --> 01:30:26.100
Yeah!


01:30:26.110 --> 01:30:30.440
Mr. Gummer,
