01:30:30.450 --> 01:30:33.250
- Roger that.
- By the way,


01:30:33.290 --> 01:30:34.780
nice work.


01:30:36.260 --> 01:30:38.750
Dad was right.
You are a hard-ass!


01:30:39.430 --> 01:30:41.450
